      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-26T05:11:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why strip this information out of deps.SharedLibs if you\u0027re just going to have to look it up again when iterating over deps.SharedLibs below?  Why not call extractVersion on each element in the loop?",
      "revId": "de396a95dcc8983db7d700dbdd30aa6b6b79931c",
