      },
      "lineNbr": 989,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-26T06:27:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Version numbers must be removed from SharedLibs, LateSharedLibs, etc. before running rewriteNdkLibs just below.\n\nOtherwise, lib names like \"libc#10\" are incorrectly recognized as non-NDK (or non-LLNDK) libs. So, for example, when building for libutils for vendor, shared_libs: [\"libc#10\"] will not make a dependency to the LLNDK stub of libc, but a dependency to the vendor variant of libc, which does not exist.\n\nerror: system/core/libutils/Android.bp:126:1: dependency \"libc\" of \"libutils\" missing variant:\n  arch:android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a73, image:vendor, link:shared, version:impl\navailable variants:\n  arch:android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a73, image:core, link:shared, version:25\n  arch:android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a73, image:core, link:shared, version:26\n  arch:android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a73, image:core, link:shared, version:27\n  arch:android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a73, image:core, link:shared, version:impl\n...",
      "parentUuid": "edb8d02d_359dc50d",
      "revId": "de396a95dcc8983db7d700dbdd30aa6b6b79931c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
